      "id": "claim_d6a4376e56d94a2ca71f840380a224ff",
      "statement": "The client previews successful output with `ReactMarkdown` and `remarkGfm`; it can copy the raw Markdown to the clipboard or download it locally as `xianlong-min-tailored-resume.md` without another server request.",
